{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1026","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1026/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1026/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1026/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1026","id":709627446,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3MDk2Mjc0NDY=","number":1026,"title":"Can't build AppImage without deb","user":{"login":"lights0123","id":3756309,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTYzMDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3756309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123","html_url":"https://github.com/lights0123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lights0123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1449401604,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDQ5NDAxNjA0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2020-09-26T22:53:30Z","updated_at":"2021-01-27T02:03:25Z","closed_at":"2021-01-27T02:03:25Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nI want to build an AppImage, but I'm not interested in building a .deb file.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n- Set tauri.bundle.targets to any **array** excluding `deb`—for example, `[\"osx\", \"msi\", \"appimage\", \"dmg\"]`\r\n- Delete `target/release/bundle`\r\n- Bundle the app (I'm using vue-cli-plugin-tauri, so `yarn tauri:build`)\r\n- Observe the following failure: ``error: Shell Scripting Error:`error running appimage.sh` ``\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe build succeeds\r\n\r\n**Platform and Versions (please complete the following information):**\r\n<!-- You can use the `tauri info` command to get this information -->\r\nOperating System - Linux(5.8.10-arch1-1) - linux/x64\r\n\r\nNode.js environment\r\n  Node.js - 14.12.0\r\n  tauri.js - 0.12.0\r\n\r\nRust environment\r\n  rustc - 1.48.0-nightly\r\n  cargo - 1.48.0-nightly\r\n  tauri-bundler - 0.9.3\r\n\r\nGlobal packages\r\n  NPM - 6.14.7\r\n  yarn - 1.22.5\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nTotal guess, but here's my thoughts:\r\nThe build process for an AppImage requires a deb to be built. So, it should automatically add a deb target if an AppImage is to be produced. *However*, that logic only occurs when a string is passed into the `targets` property, and not an array. So, this logic should be also extend to passing in an array.","closed_by":{"login":"lucasfernog","id":20051258,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDUxMjU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20051258?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasfernog","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasfernog","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasfernog/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasfernog/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasfernog/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"htt